<section class="section reveal" style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto">
<h2 style="text-align:center">SHIPPING AND DELIVERY</h2>
<p class="sub" style="text-align:center">SAFE AND ON TIME</p>
<p>We are committed to delivering your jewellery safely and on time.</p>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">DELIVERY TIMELINE</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>Standard Delivery: 7-10 business days</li>
<li>Express Delivery: 2-3 business days (additional charges apply)</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:8px">We currently ship and deliver our products worldwide. No matter where you are located, we strive to ensure your order reaches you safely and securely. Shipping timelines may vary depending on the destination country, customs procedures, and local courier services.</p>
<p style="margin-top:8px">Once your order is dispatched, you will receive a tracking link via email. You can track your order status at any time.</p>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">PLEASE NOTE</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>Saturdays, Sundays and all public holidays are considered non-working days</li>
<li>Delivery may take longer than usual during sale events and peak seasons — we appreciate your patience</li>
<li>Please ensure your delivery address and phone number are correct</li>
<li>Someone must be available to receive the package at the delivery address</li>
</ul>
</section>
